  "prefLabel": "Tax 215.05 Burden of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 215.05 Burden of Proof. In discretionary easement, revitalization, betterment assessment, qualifying historic buildings, farm structures and land under farm structures, and qualifying chartered public school appeals, the taxpayer shall have the burden to prove the municipality’s denial or decision was either made in bad faith or was discriminatory.\n\nSource. #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
